# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages clean-URL rewrites.
#
# We link to /pricing, /about, /privacy, /terms in the nav, sitemap and
# canonicals so the canonical URLs match the address bar. Without these
# rewrites, those paths would 404 because the static host can only serve
# the literal .html files.
#
# `200` is a rewrite (URL stays clean in the browser); `301` would change
# the URL to the .html version. We want rewrites.

/pricing   /pricing.html   200
/about     /about.html     200
/privacy   /privacy.html   200
/terms     /terms.html     200
